     This is my second time purchasing this exact body wash, and I’ll be buying it again. I have a very picky almost-11-year-old, and she absolutely loves this stuff — especially the Milk & Honey scent. The smell is gentle but comforting, and the texture feels soft and creamy without being heavy or overly perfumed. I’m more of a bar-soap person myself, but I tried it too and really liked how it left my skin feeling clean without dryness. What surprised me most, though, was the unintended side effect: my daughter started wanting to bathe more often — completely unprompted. No reminders. No negotiating. That alone says a lot. The only downside (and this is very much a “good problem”) is that she now wants to use it as hand soap because she loves how it makes her hands feel. At this rate, I may need a lock-and-key system to save it for actual bath time 😄 All jokes aside, it’s gentle, smells lovely, and clearly works well for sensitive, picky users. If all problems were this minimal, life would be easy. 100% recommend — and yes, I’ll be buying it again. 

