     Gentle, clean feel with a light, pleasant scent 

 Reviewed in Canada on December 16, 2025 Scent: Water Lily Size: 1.04 l (Pack of 1) Verified Purchase 









     I’ve been using Ivory Mild & Gentle Body Wash (Water Lily scent) daily, and it lives up to its name. The formula is very gentle on the skin—no irritation or dryness, even with regular use—which makes it a great option for sensitive skin. The Water Lily scent is light and clean, not overpowering, and it doesn’t linger too long after showering, which I personally prefer. The body wash lathers well with just a small amount and rinses off easily without leaving any residue. I also appreciate the large 1.03 L size, which offers good value and lasts a long time. The pump bottle is convenient and mess-free. Overall, this is a reliable, no-frills body wash that focuses on being gentle and effective. I would recommend it to anyone looking for a mild, everyday body wash with a subtle fragrance. 

